# Codecov uploader binary (8 MB) — downloaded on demand, never published
codecov

# GitHub Pages site — lives on the web, not in the package
docs/

# Docs sources: English content and its translations. These build docs/ and
# are irrelevant to package consumers.
content/
i18n/

# Repo tooling / CI, irrelevant to package consumers
.github/
.gstack/
tool/
tools/
deploy.sh
run.sh
benchmark.sh
DEPLOY.md
CODECOV.md
CONTRIBUTING.md

# Benchmark suite (295 files / 428 KB of case sources and result JSON) —
# useful in the repo, dead weight for a consumer.
benchmark/

# The nested Flutter demo app and its plan doc. example/fxdart_example.dart
# stays: pub.dev renders and scores it, so a bare example/ entry here would
# cost that scored category.
example/daily_ledger/
example/dart_comparison_plan.md

# Built Flutter web demo + CanvasKit WASM (~41 MB). The source is
# example/daily_ledger/; this tree is what build_docs copies into docs/.
# web/ is the rest of the docs-site chrome (CSS/JS/logos) — GitHub Pages,
# not the package.
web/

# Do not ignore pkgs/. `cd pkgs/fxdart_lints && dart pub publish` still
# reads this file (the git root), so `pkgs/` hides that package's own
# pubspec, LICENSE and README and the publish dies. fxdart_lints is a
# few dozen KB; leaving it in the fxdart tarball is cheaper than
# breaking the nested publish.

# Tests live on GitHub. Consumers never run them from the tarball.
test/
test.sh

# Internal notes
ARROW_MIGRATION_BLOCKER.md

# Agent-harness instructions for this repo, not API documentation. Anchored so a
# future consumer-facing skills/**/CLAUDE.md still ships. AGENTS.md is untracked
# and listed in .git/info/exclude, yet it shipped before this entry existed:
# .pubignore replaces gitignore semantics, so git-ignored is not archive-excluded.
/AGENTS.md
/CLAUDE.md

# Working plans — local only. .pubignore fully overrides .gitignore, so the
# .gitignore entry for plans/ does NOT keep it out of the published archive.
plans/

# Build & local artifacts (normally covered by .gitignore, which
# .pubignore overrides once present)
coverage/
.dart_tool/
.DS_Store
*.log
